    starting_price: 79152,
    sections: [
      { title: `Villa snapshot`, content: `This elegant 3-BHK villa is a pet-friendly retreat with a private pool & lush garden. The ground floor features a living area, a modern kitchen, & an inviting dining space. Each bedroom has en suite bathrooms, garden views, & premium amenities. The standout feature is the expansive 0.5-acre outdoor area with sports equipment & patio furniture. Perfect for unwinding by the pool or enjoying peaceful surroundings, this villa offers a serene escape with top 5-star service dedicated to "Atithi Devo Bhava." Bedrooms Bedroom 1 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | AC | Fan | TV | Sofa set | Work/ study desk space | Wardrobe space | Garden view | Located on the ground floor Bedroom 2 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | AC | Fan | TV | Sofa set | Pouffes | Work/ study desk space | Wardrobe space | Garden view | Located on the ground floor Bedroom 3 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | AC | Fan | TV | Sofa chair | Dressing table with pouffe | Wardrobe space | Garden view | Located on the ground floor Bathrooms Each en-suite bathroom has shower, geyser, and hand jet spray | Hairdryer | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode Living Room Sofa sets, sofa chairs and a centre table | 65” TV | AC | Fan | Garden view | Powder room | Located on the ground floor Kitchen Modern kitchen with ample storage space | Fully equipped with all the necessary appliances like refrigerator, oven, microwave, toaster, water purifier/ RO, kettle, rice-cooker, crockery and cooking utensils | Located on the ground floor Dining A 6-seater dining table near the living room | Located on the ground floor Sitting Area Outdoor sitting area at the entrance of the villa Garden 0.5 acre lush garden | Patio furniture seating | Slide | Outdoor sports equipment Outdoor Pool Private pool | Loungers` },
      { title: `Meals`, content: `Enjoy a selection of veg and non-veg meals during your stay.` },
      { title: `House rules`, content: `Check-in & check-out: Standard check-in time is 2 pm, and check-out is at 10 am. Refund Policy: For cancellations that comply with our policy terms, refunds will be processed as per the details below: 1. Refunds are only available if the full payment has been made; partial payments are non-refundable. 2. Refunds will be processed within 7-9 days post cancellation request. Security deposit refund policy: 10,000 Reimbursement will be processed within 4-7 working days post-property inspection. Your strict adherence to this timeline is highly appreciated. Noise & disturbances: Please be considerate of your neighbours and maintain a reasonable noise level, especially between 10 pm and 7 am. Refrain from hosting loud parties or events on the property. Smoking: Smoking is strictly prohibited inside the villa. Designated smoking areas are available outdoors. Chewing tobacco: Strictly prohibited with no exceptions. Pets: Pets are allowed on the property. *Pet Friendly Property | Pet Policy* Pets Are Family – And They’re Welcome Here! We’re thrilled to host your furry friends at our pet-friendly homes. To ensure a safe and comfortable stay for all, here’s everything you need to know: Pet Security Deposit • 1 Pet – ₹10,000 (Refundable) • 2 Pets – ₹15,000 (Refundable) Collected in addition to the standard security deposit. Pet Sanitation Fee (One-time, collected at check-in) • 1BHK – ₹1,000 • 2/3BHK – ₹2,000 • 4/5BHK+ – ₹3,000 • Prive Collection – ₹4,000 Kindly Note • Pets are not allowed in the pool – A care charge of ₹10,000 will apply if this is overlooked. • Clean-up is your responsibility – Please pick up after your pets. • Damages, if any, will be charged at actuals. We love pets—and we’re so glad you brought yours along! Thank you for helping us keep our spaces clean, safe, and welcoming for everyone Maximum occupancy: Adhere to the maximum occupancy limit for your villa. Any additional guests must be approved by the management beforehand. Damage & breakages: Guests are responsible for any damages or breakages during their stay. Please report any incidents to the management promptly. Charges may apply for repairs or replacements. Cleanliness: Please maintain the cleanliness of the villa during your stay. Use designated trash bins for disposing of garbage and avoid littering the property. Safety & security: Ensure that all doors and windows are locked when leaving the villa unattended. Amenities & facilities: Use the provided amenities and facilities responsibly, and follow any posted guidelines. Compliance: All guests must comply with local laws and regulations. Any illegal activities on the property will result in immediate eviction and potential legal consequences. Upkeep: Daily cleaning of our property is compulsory. We kindly request your cooperation with our housekeeping staff. Standard occupancy 6 Guests.​ Max occupancy: 8 guests (Extra charges applicable for each guest above standard occupancy)` },
      { title: `Nearest places`, content: `Trip Machine Cafe - 4.3 km Cafe Dori - 10.8 km Blanca - 10.6 km` }
    ],
