    description: `Tucked away in a gated complex near Anjuna Beach, this exquisite 4-BHK villa offers a perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and charm! Step into the ground-floor living room that radiates warmth and elegance, designed with plush teal sofas, and a sleek wall-mounted TV. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors flood the space with natural light and open directly to the private pool. Nearby, the well-equipped kitchen with a stylish island leads effortlessly into a cosy dining space that comfortably seats six. Upstairs, the first-floor living space showcases earthy tones and cosy ambiance with rust-colored sofas, perfectly complemented by a macrame swing. The floral pouffes and a chic white table bring a playful contrast, leading to an attached balcony—an ideal setting for unwinding. Each of the four bedrooms is designed with modern decor, ensuite bathrooms and thoughtful detailing, with two opening onto private balconies. Outdoors, the private pool is framed by lush tropical foliage, perfect for soaking up the sun. The spacious terrace features checkered grey-and-white flooring, overlooking a charming neighborhood dotted with lush palm trees. Rooted in the ethos of "Atithi Devo Bhava," a top 5-star hospitality team is committed to ensuring every guest is pampered with exceptional care and attention. Bedrooms Bedroom 1 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 150 sq.ft | AC | Fan | 55” TV | Wardrobe space | Lounge chair | Attached balcony | Located on the first floor Bedroom 2 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 150 sq.ft | AC | Fan | Wardrobe space | Attached balcony | Located on the first floor Bedroom 3 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 150 sq.ft | AC | Fan | TV | Wing chair | Sofa settee | Wardrobe space | Attached balcony | Located on the ground floor Bedroom 4 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 150 sq.ft | AC | Fan | Wardrobe space | Workstation | Located on the ground floor En suite bathrooms Shower, geyser and hand jet spray | Hair dryer | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode Living room 1 L-shaped sofa and a centre table | Elegant light fixtures | 55” TV | Speaker | 2 ACs | Fan | Pool access | Located on the ground floor Living room 2 Sofa sets, pouffes and a centre table | Macrame swing | Fan | AC | Attached balcony | Located on the first floor Kitchen Ample storage space | Fully equipped with all the necessary appliances like a refrigerator, oven, microwave, gas cooktop, toaster, dishwasher, water purifier/RO, mixer/grinder, kettle, rice-cooker, crockery and cooking utensils | Kitchen island | Located on the ground floor Dining A 6-seater dining table near the living room | Pool view and access | Located on the ground floor Outdoor pool Private pool | 152 sq.ft | Outdoor shower | 4.5 ft | Lush foliage Terrace Spacious terrace | Checkered grey-and-white flooring | Scenic views`,
