    has_pool: true,
    description: `Tucked away in a peaceful locale, this exquisite 3-bedroom retreat boasts a private swimming pool and an atmosphere of calm and elegance. The captivating entrance fuses modern style with classic charm, featuring antique accents and grand staircases that lead to two beautifully appointed bedrooms on the upper floor. Upon entering, you are welcomed by a seamless flow from the fully equipped kitchen to the expansive living and dining areas. Bathed in natural light through grand floor-to-ceiling windows, these spaces offer stunning views of the lush, well-maintained patio (backyard) area. The living area, adorned with a plush sofa and artfully chosen cushions, radiates comfort and sophistication. The wooden tables, complemented by carefully selected decor, add character and warmth, elevating the inviting atmosphere of the space. Above, pendant lights with rattan shades create a soft, warm glow over the dining table, perfect for both intimate dinners and entertaining guests. The adjacent kitchen combines modern aesthetics with functionality. Its sleek cabinetry, complemented by a subtle backsplash and state-of-the-art appliances, blends seamlessly with the pool area, making it ideal for social gatherings. The poolside is a haven of relaxation, featuring a tranquil turquoise pool surrounded by greenery. The lush plants enhance the refreshing atmosphere while sliding glass doors open up to merge indoor and outdoor living spaces, creating a sense of expansive luxury. Natural light floods the villa through a skylight in the common area. The three bedrooms, each meticulously designed, offer luxurious beds, en-suite bathrooms, and stylish decor. The master suite stands out with its spacious layout and a balcony that provides breathtaking views of the verdant surroundings. The bathrooms, with their modern fixtures, skylights, and high-end toiletries, add a touch of elegance. Rooted in the ethos of "Atithi Devo Bhava," a top 5-star hospitality team is committed to ensuring every guest is pampered with exceptional care and attention. Note: Located just 700 meters from Cloud 7 and in close proximity to Anjuna Beach. Bedrooms Bedroom 1 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | AC | Fan | Wardrobe space | Pool view & access | Located on the ground floor Bathroom 1 Shower, geyser, and hand jet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode | Hairdryer Bedroom 2 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | AC | Fan | Wardrobe space | Sofa chair & a table | Hanging cane lamp | Attached balcony | Located on the first floor Bathroom 2 Shower, geyser, and hand jet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode | Skylight Bedroom 3 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | AC | Fan | Wardrobe space | Attached balcony | Located on the first floor Bathroom 3 Shower, geyser, and hand jet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode | Skylight Living Room Pool view and access | Attached outdoor patio with scenic vistas | Ground floor Amenities Sofa set, sofa chairs, and centre tables | 55” TV | 2 ACs | Fan | Bamboo cane lights | Light fixtures & soft lightening | Floor-to-ceiling sliding glass doors Kitchen Fully equipped | Ample storage space | Ground floor Appliances Refrigerator | Microwave | Oven | Mixer/grinder | Kettle | Rice-cooker | Water purifier/RO | Crockery | Cutlery Dining A 6-seater dining table | Near the living room | Located on the ground floor | Pool view & access | Floor-to-ceiling sliding glass doors | Attached outdoor patio with views | Cane hanging lights Indoor Pool Private pool | 4.5 ft | Exposed brick wall | Living space, bedroom & kitchen access | Skylights`,
