    description: `Nestled in the heart of Goa Vagator, discover a luxurious 3-bedroom villa with a private swimming pool. As you approach the entrance, a sense of calm and elegance welcomes you. The villa's facade, with its clean lines and refined design, sets the stage for the exceptional experience inside. Upon entering, you're welcomed by an expansive living area that seamlessly blends modern design with an inviting ambience. Natural light floods the room through floor-to-ceiling glass doors, revealing a lush garden view. The decor is an artful mix of warm tones and contemporary elements, with plush sofas and stylish armchairs inviting relaxation. A sleek entertainment unit with a large-screen TV promises relaxing movie nights, while carefully curated artworks add character to the space. A skylight in the common area allows natural light to flood the space. To your right, the dining area features a beautifully crafted wooden table, perfect for memorable meals with family and friends. Next to the dining area, there's an open kitchen perfect for cooking enthusiasts. Equipped with state-of-the-art appliances, it combines functionality and style, catering to all your cooking needs. Stepping out from the living room, you enter a private oasis—a stunning outdoor pool area. The sparkling blue pool, framed by lush tropical plants, offers a serene environment to unwind and soak up the Goan sun. Comfortable loungers invite you to relax with a book or simply enjoy the tranquillity. As you explore further, you'll discover the villa's three beautifully appointed bedrooms. Each room is a cosy retreat with plush beds, ample storage, en-suite bathrooms, and elegant decor. The master bedroom stands out with its spacious layout and scenic balcony, offering breathtaking views of the surrounding greenery. The bathrooms are modern and luxurious, fitted with high-quality fixtures, skylights, and stocked with premium toiletries, ensuring a spa-like experience. This property is serviced by a handpicked team from a top 5-star hospitality brand, embracing the Indian philosophy of “Atithi Devo Bhava.” Guests enjoy 24/7 assistance, ensuring a seamless and luxurious stay. Note: Located just 700 meters from Cloud 7 and in close proximity to Anjuna Beach. Bedrooms Bedroom 1 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | AC | Fan | Wardrobe space | Sofa chair | Attached balcony | Pool view | Located on the first floor Bathroom 1 Shower, geyser, and hand jet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode | Skylight Bedroom 2 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | AC | Fan | Wardrobe space | Attached balcony | Located on the first floor Bathroom 2 Shower, geyser, and hand jet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode | Skylight Bedroom 3 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | AC | Fan | Wardrobe space | Located on the ground floor Bathroom 3 Shower, geyser, and hand jet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode Living Room Seating: sofa set, sofa chairs, and a centre table | 55” TV | Music system | 2 ACs | Fan | Bamboo cane lamps | Pool view and access | Located on the ground floor Kitchen Modern kitchen with ample storage space | Fully equipped with all the necessary appliances like refrigerator, microwave, coffee machine, mixer/grinder, kettle, crockery and cooking utensils | Located on the ground floor Dining A 6-seater dining table near the living room | Located on the ground floor Swimming Pool Outdoor, private pool | 4.5 ft depth`,
