    has_pool: true,
    description: `Hey there! Let me introduce you to our cozy 4-bedroom villa in Nerul, North Goa. Imagine this: You're in a quiet, peaceful area right next to stunning paddy fields. This isn’t just a place to crash; it’s where memories are made. Our villa, complete with an L-shaped pool that's snuggled up against the fields, gives you the best of both worlds—luxury and nature. Inside the Villa As soon as you walk in, you'll feel a sense of space. It’s perfect for up to 8 people. Now, imagine chilling in a living room with glass walls. You won’t miss a second of that gorgeous garden and pool view even if you're inside. And hey, if you’re the chef of the group, you’re going to love our kitchen. It’s loaded with top-notch appliances. Feel like a MasterChef right in your holiday home! The bedrooms? Oh, you’re in for a treat. Fully furnished with air conditioning and private bathrooms with all natural toiletries. And get this: one room gives you a balcony view of the fields, while another shows off the well-designed complex. Both are perfect spots for that morning coffee or late-night chat. The dining room is more than just a place to eat. With seating for 8 and both AC and a fan, it's a comfy spot for all your meals and conversations. Access Guide When you book this beauty, you get the whole package—the bedrooms, the living and dining areas, and that extraordinary pool that’s practically hugging the paddy fields. Plus, there's parking if you’re bringing a car along. It's all yours to enjoy!`,
