    has_pool: true,
    description: `Enveloped by verdant surroundings, Casa Ikkebana is an exquisite 4-bedroom retreat gracefully situated in the calm of Assagao. As you enter, you're greeted by a refined seating area that leads to a peaceful passage. On the left, a glass window gently adds to the atmosphere, while on the right, a comfortable bedroom and a stylish powder room invite you in. As you move through, an expansive living area unfolds, with large glass windows offering unobstructed views of the pristine pool and lush garden, enhancing the sense of openness. The space is enhanced by elegant chandeliers, tasteful decor, a music system, and four air conditioning units, all contributing to its understated elegance. A bespoke bar counter adds a touch of sophistication, while the thoughtfully crafted dining area sets the perfect stage for indulgent dining experiences. Adjacent to the dining area, the kitchen is meticulously designed, featuring a large glass window and equipped with high-quality appliances, fine crockeries, and all the essentials for a seamless cooking experience. Stepping outside, a beautifully landscaped green wall frames a private pool retreat, complemented by a sparkling jacuzzi. The poolside deck, adorned with a four-seater patio set and a sleek bar counter with plush sofa seating, serves as a captivating highlight. Ascending the staircase, bathed in golden light, reveals a space enriched with a sophisticated lamp and a plush sofa, offering an ideal vantage point to admire the elegance of the living area below. The master bedroom is a true statement of sophistication, featuring a spacious wardrobe, a meticulously crafted wooden bed and an artfully arranged seating area. A private balcony, overlooking the pool, further enhances the room’s serene atmosphere. The bedrooms are carefully crafted, with attention to detail in every element. Each room features tasteful decor, en suite bathrooms, and large scenic windows that allow natural light to fill the space. A dedicated 5-star hospitality team upholds the essence of Atithi Devo Bhava, with personalized touches such as a butler, chef-on-call, a well-stocked fridge, and a premium welcome basket, ensuring every aspect of your stay is impeccably cared for. Bedroom 1 Coral Nest A stylish first-floor suite featuring a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, cosy sofa chairs, and a private balcony with seating. Bathroom 1 Fitted with a shower complemented by premium organic toiletries, towels, and a hairdryer. Bedroom 2 Elysian Escape This first-floor suite offers a king-sized bed, a private balcony with seating, and an ensuite bathroom. Bathroom 2 Includes a shower, premium organic toiletries, towels, and a hairdryer. Bedroom 3 Ivory Bliss An elegant ground-floor retreat with a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, and stylish seating. Bathroom 3 This bathroom is equipped with a shower, organic toiletries, and plush towels. Bathroom 4 Rosewood Suite An inviting first-floor suite that blends comfort and charm, featuring a king-sized bed, an ensuite bathroom, and a cosy window seat. Bathroom 4 Equipped with a shower, a hairdryer, and premium organic toiletries. Lagoon Oasis Take a refreshing dip in the private pool, rinse off in the outdoor shower, or relax in the soothing jacuzzi, all complemented by a stylish outdoor bar counter. Hall of Grandeur The exquisite living area is adorned with elegant furnishings, a stunning chandelier, and a convenient powder room. Dining Delight The kitchen offers modern appliances like a microwave, air fryer, and refrigerator, while the elegant six-seater dining table is conveniently placed near the living room.`,
    short_description: `Enveloped by verdant surroundings, Casa Ikkebana is an exquisite 4-bedroom retreat gracefully situated in the calm of Assagao. As you enter, you're greeted by a refined seating area that leads to a peaceful passage. On...`,
