    bathrooms: 4,
    max_guests: 10,
    has_pool: true,
    description: `Set in the peaceful locale of Assagao, this 4-bedroom villa is a pristine marvel in the heart of Goa. Amidst lush greenery, its exterior captivates with graceful architecture, and a beautiful ivory gate leads you into the core of this haven. As you step inside, the grand living area greets you with modern elegance—expansive windows, chequered flooring, and intricate ceiling details that bathe the space with natural light. The neutral palette, accented with tasteful pops of colour, creates a warm and inviting ambience. At the heart of the space lies a sparkling pool that reflects the surrounding greenery, creating a calming vibe. The pool is surrounded by a beautifully crafted wooden deck, offering ample space for lounging or hosting intimate gatherings. As twilight falls, the private swimming pool and jacuzzi sparkle like diamonds, offering a serene retreat under the star-studded sky. The highlight is the charming gazebo, adorned with intricate ironwork and stylish seating; which serves as a shaded retreat. This cosy nook is perfect for sipping morning coffee, enjoying peaceful moments, or hosting conversations under the natural canopy. The vibrant turquoise kitchen equipped with top-notch appliances and decked with patterned flooring, is a culinary delight. It flows seamlessly into an exquisite dining area, ideal for sophisticated gatherings and refined soirées. The four elegantly designed bedrooms of the villa exude warmth & indulgence. Each features plush beds with premium linens, soothing colour palettes, and elegant seating corners. Large windows flood the rooms with natural light, offering picturesque views of the greenery outside. Thoughtful details like stylish headboards, cosy seating nooks, and curated decor add personality to each space while maintaining a cohesive design theme. Villa Suntuarios, a true reflection of coastal elegance, is ideally located near the iconic Anjuna and Vagator Beaches, and just moments away from renowned cafes like Gunpowder, Jamun, and Sukkha. A peaceful haven by the coast, this villa captures the essence of seaside living, offering a serene space to relax and recharge. Enhancing the experience is a dedicated 5-star hospitality team, reflecting the spirit of Atithi Devo Bhava . From a butler and chef-on-call to a well-stocked fridge and a premium welcome basket, every detail is meticulously curated to ensure that every aspect of your stay is nothing short of perfect. Bedroom-1 Ivory Oasis A stylish second-floor suite designed for ultimate comfort, featuring a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, elegant sofa chairs, and a private balcony. Bathroom-1 Equipped with a shower, hairdryer, organic toiletries, and towels. Bedroom-2 Celestial Chamber This first-floor suite boasts a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, and a balcony. Bathroom- 2 The bathroom includes a shower, a hairdryer, towels and premium organic toiletries. Bedroom-3 Sapphire Suite An elegant first-floor retreat with a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, and a cosy window seat. Bathroom-3 Fitted with a shower, organic toiletries, and plush towels. Bedroom-4 Crystal Cove On the second floor, this suite combines elegance and comfort with a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, and a window seat. Bathroom-4 Fitted with a shower, a hairdryer, and premium organic toiletries. The Ivy Grand Hall The grand living area features classy furnishings, large windows, a chic bar counter with a powder room and lift access. Dining Delight The kitchen offers modern appliances like a microwave, refrigerator, and toaster, while the elegant six-seater dining table is conveniently placed near the living room. Shimmering Swimming Pool Take a refreshing dip in the private pool, complete with an outdoor shower, or relax in the jacuzzi, all set against a poolside gazebo.`,
