    description: `With its pristine white exterior and modern architectural design, this exquisite 4-BHK villa reflects elegance where every space is a visual delight, creating a serene and inviting retreat that's perfect for a getaway! Step inside, where the grand living room instantly captivates with its floor-to-ceiling glass windows, striking chandeliers, and a chic semi-circular sofa. The space is brought to life with classy furnishings and a stunning reindeer sculpture that serves as a unique centrepiece. Each of the four bedrooms offers a distinctive charm: three open onto private balconies, perfect for morning coffee with a view, while one features a luxurious bathtub for relaxation. Plush bedding, tasteful decor, and thoughtful touches in every room ensure a restful retreat. The open-layout kitchen combines elegance and function, equipped with everything you need for effortless meal prep. Nearby, an elegant 8-seater dining table provides the ideal setting for shared meals, set under an artistic light feature. The terrace is a beautifully designed space, crafted for both leisure and celebration. The sunken seating area, framed by the soothing sound of a water feature, is the perfect spot to unwind under the starlit sky. An outdoor bar counter stands ready for evening cocktails, while a cosy cabana, complete with a jacuzzi, becomes the ultimate corner to enjoy golden sunsets. To elevate this experience, a dedicated 5-star hospitality team is always on hand, ready to assist with a warm smile and genuine care, embodying the true essence of "Atithi Devo Bhava." From a butler and chef-on-call to a well-stocked fridge and a premium welcome basket, every detail is thoughtfully arranged to make guests feel cared for and pampered! A complimentary e-bike is also available on-site for your convenience and local exploration. Crystal Lagoon Dive into the L-shaped private pool, complemented by an outdoor shower, cosy loungers, and a charming poolside seating area surrounded by a lush garden. Skyview Mirage Enjoy a private, secluded setting with a spacious terrace, shaded gazebo, contemporary jacuzzi, sunken seating pit, and serene water features, surrounded by palm trees, lush views, and complete with a stylish bar, cabana, and powder room. The Celestial Lounge The grand living room sets the tone with a chic semi-circular sofa, classy furnishings, and floor-to-ceiling windows. A stunning chandelier and a unique reindeer sculpture complete the elegant decor. Bedroom-1 The Solstice Suite A stylish first-floor suite designed for ultimate comfort, featuring a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, warm light fixtures, round swing chair, and a private balcony. Bathroom-1 The bathroom includes a bathtub, shower, hairdryer, towels and premium organic toiletries. Bedroom-2 Skye Haven Unwind in this elegant first-floor retreat showcasing a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, stylish seating, a balcony, and stunning ceiling art that adds a unique touch. Bathroom-2 Fitted with a shower, organic toiletries, and plush towels. Bedroom-3 Malibu Chamber On the first floor, this suite combines charm and comfort, offering a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, cosy extra seating, and a balcony. Bathroom-3 Features a shower, hairdryer, organic toiletries, and towels for your comfort. Bedroom-4 Tiffany Suite This stylish ground-floor suite is a perfect retreat, boasting a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, elegant seating, unique wall art and a dressing table. Bathroom-4 Equipped with a shower, hairdryer, organic toiletries, and towels. Dining Delight The kitchen features modern appliances including a microwave, refrigerator, and toaster. The stylish eight-seater dining table is perfectly positioned near the living room, complete with AC and a striking light feature.`,
