    description: `With sweeping 360-degree views of nature, discover a hidden gem in Jaipur that redefines grandeur. The estate boasts a sparkling pool and a vast garden with comfortable seating for an exquisite à la carte dining experience beneath the starlit sky. The 4-bedroom pet-friendly villa is highlighted by a grand living area featuring a snooker table, where each window reveals a breathtaking masterpiece of nature’s beauty. Unwind with stunning sunsets from the terrace or simply relax in the serene comfort of your bedroom window seat, soaking in the peaceful surroundings. For younger guests, there is a pool cum jacuzzi, along with a dedicated play zone featuring games and outdoor equipment for their enjoyment. Throughout your stay, indulge in exceptional services from a dedicated 5-star hospitality team, embodying the essence of "Atithi Devo Bhava". Bedrooms Bedroom 1 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | Area: 200 sq.ft | AC | 55” TV | Fan | Hanging light Heater | Electric kettle | Outdoor patio with seating | Garden view | Seating: chairs & a table | Located on the ground floor Bathroom 1 Shower, geyser, hairdryer and hand jet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode | Wardrobe Bedroom 2 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | Area: 225 sq.ft | AC | Fan | Window seating with view | Heater | Hanging lamp | Electric kettle | Attached balcony with seating | Seating: Chairs & a table | Located on the first floor Bathroom 2 Shower, geyser, hairdryer and hand jet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode | Wardrobe Bedroom 3 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | Area: 200 sq.ft | AC | Fan | Hanging light | Floor-to-ceiling windows & doors | Heater | Electric kettle | Seating: chair & a table | Pool view | Located on the ground floor Bathroom 3 Shower, geyser, hairdryer and hand jet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode | Wardrobe | Hair dryer Bedroom 4 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | Area: 200 sq.ft | AC | Fan | Electric kettle | Heater | Hanging lamp | Seating: chair & a table | Scenic view | Located on the first floor Bathroom 4 Shower, geyser, hairdryer and hand jet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode | Wardrobe Living Room Area: 1000 sq.ft | Sofa set and a centre table | Pax: 10 | Ceiling cassette ACs | Stone cladding wall | Fan | Lounge chairs | Floor-to-ceiling windows & doors | Pool views | Snooker table | Unique decor corner | Music system | Located on the ground floor Indoor kitchen Modern kitchen with ample storage space | Fully equipped with all the necessary appliances: refrigerator, oven, microwave, toaster, mixer/grinder, kettle, water purifier/ RO, gas cooktop, BBQ utensils, induction cookware, crockery and cooking utensils | Floor-to-ceiling doors | Located on the ground floor Note: Only light cooking and reheating are permitted in the indoor kitchen, as a cloud kitchen is available on the property Outdoor kitchen (commercial) Open kitchen with ample storage space | Fully equipped with all the necessary appliances: refrigerator, oven, microwave, toaster, mixer/grinder, kettle, water purifier/ RO, gas cooktop, BBQ utensils, induction cookware, crockery and cooking utensils | Located near the garden Note: Guests are not allowed to cook in the commercial kitchen. Dining An 8-seater dining table | Near the living room | Located on the ground floor | Floor-to-ceiling glass doors | AC | Warm lights | Ceiling cassette ACs Garden Expansive lush garden | Area: 2500 sq.ft | Outdoor sports equipment | Outdoor kids games | Seating: Chairs and a table Swimming Pool Outdoor, private pool | Area (sq.ft): 200 | Depth: 4 ft | Loungers | Kids’ pool cum jacuzzi (Area: 5*5) | Pool deck | Restrooms | Bonfire set up | Poolside seating: chairs & a table Terrace Views of the surroundings | Seating: chairs and a table | Located on the first floor`,
