    has_pool: false,
    description: `Nestled in a picturesque setting, this elegant 3-BHK villa is a perfect escape for those seeking tranquility with a touch of luxury! This villa’s facade combines classic mountain charm with modern elegance, featuring sloping red-tiled roofs, dark stone-clad walls, and sleek glass railings. Each of the three beautifully designed bedrooms comes with an ensuite bathroom, while two extend onto private balconies—offering breathtaking views of the surrounding landscape. The living room blends vintage charm with modern comfort, featuring plush Chesterfield sofas in rich brown leather, a classic wingback chair, pouffes and a TV, creating the perfect spot to relax and enjoy a movie night. Golden drapes frame the large window, letting in natural light that brightens the space and offers a glimpse of the outdoors. The dining area, designed for intimate gatherings, comfortably seats six, with a well-equipped kitchen just steps away for added convenience. Start your day with a steaming cup of coffee in this serene outdoor oasis, or end your evenings by the bonfire, soaking in the stunning surroundings. This corner features rich wooden bench seating that wraps that lines the space, complemented by warm brick flooring and soft ambient lighting from the lamp posts. It also offers a serene vantage point overlooking the lush green expanse and winding hillside road. Rooted in the ethos of "Atithi Devo Bhava," a top 5-star hospitality team is committed to ensuring every guest is pampered with exceptional care and attention. Bedrooms Bedroom 1 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 350 sq.ft | 42” TV | AC | Fan | Heater | Workstation | Wardrobe space | Electric kettle | Dressing room | Attached patio | Located on the ground floor Bedroom 2 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 350 sq.ft | 42” TV | AC | Fan | Heater | Sofa | Workstation | Wardrobe space | Electric kettle | Dressing room | Attached balcony | Forest view | Located on the first floor Bedroom 3 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 350 sq.ft | 42” TV | AC | Fan | Heater | Wardrobe space | Electric kettle | Dressing room | Attached balcony | Forest view | Located on the first floor En suite bathrooms Shower, geyser and hand bidet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode Living room 300 sq.ft | Sofa sets, lounge chair, pouffes & a centre table | 52” TV | Music system | AC | Fan | Heater | Located on the ground floor Kitchen Ample storage space | Fully equipped with all the necessary appliances like refrigerator, oven, microwave, gas cooktop, toaster, mixer/grinder, kettle, dishwasher, water purifier/ RO, crockery and cutlery | Located on the ground floor Dining A 6-seater dining table near the living room | Fan | Located on the ground floor Outdoor sitting area Wooden bench seating | Brick flooring | Soft ambient lights | Hill & forest views`,
