    description: `Tucked within a serene, gated hillside enclave, this luxe 4-BHK cottage is designed for those who find joy in quiet luxury and thoughtful details! Surrounded by pine-covered slopes and panoramic valley vistas, it blends Alpine-inspired architecture with natural stone elements that mirror the landscape. Cobbled pathways, bordered by manicured planters lead to the entrance, softly lit by old-world street lamps that set a calming tone. Stepping indoors, the living room is anchored by a brown, tufted leather chesterfield sofa and teal wingback armchairs, radiating understated elegance. A statement crystal chandelier glimmers overhead, along with stylish decor and large windows. The adjacent dining area features a tufted teal bench on one side of the table, paired with four floral-patterned high-back chairs on the other. The modern kitchen is outfitted with high-gloss taupe cabinetry, premium finishes, and state-of-the-art appliances. The charming lounge area on the first floor boasts an L-shaped sofa and a uniquely shaped wooden coffee table, blending comfort with modern design. Floor-to-ceiling windows frame sweeping views from every bedroom, while the master bedroom on the first floor opens to a private balcony. Beneath a sloped ceiling with exposed wooden beams, the indoor bar area is ideal for leisurely evenings. It features a dark wood counter, two cushioned black stools, a vibrant sofa and air conditioning for added comfort. Just beyond, the spacious terrace opens up to breathtaking 360° views of the surrounding hills, framed by a border of colourful flowers. A premium clubhouse for peaceful escapes and memorable evenings, with a serene pool, elegant bar, and more for refined indulgence. To elevate this experience, a dedicated 5-star hospitality team is always on hand, ready to assist with a warm smile and genuine care, embodying the true essence of "Atithi Devo Bhava." From a butler and chef-on-call to a premium welcome basket and a thoughtful farewell gift, every detail is arranged to make guests feel cared for and pampered! Indoor Bar Beneath a sloped ceiling with exposed wooden beams, the indoor bar area features a dark wood counter, two cushioned black stools, a vibrant sofa and air conditioning for added comfort. Sky Deck The spacious terrace opens up to breathtaking 360° views of the surrounding hills, framed by a border of colourful flowers. Lounge Den The cosy lounge on the first floor boasts an L-shaped sofa and a uniquely shaped wooden coffee table, blending comfort with modern design. The Golden Pavillion The living room is anchored by a brown, tufted leather chesterfield sofa and teal wingback armchairs, radiating understated elegance. A statement crystal chandelier glimmers overhead, along with stylish decor and large windows, with a powder room nearby. Bedroom 1 Solana Manor A charming retreat on the first floor, this suite boasts panoramic views through floor-to-ceiling windows, an attached balcony, a four-poster king-sized bed, central hot & cold AC, a 62” TV, and an ensuite bathroom. Bathroom 1 Designed with a shower, signature organic toiletries, plush towels, and a hairdryer. Bedroom 2 Monte Suite Framed by picturesque hill views, this serene retreat on the first floor offers a king-sized bed, a lounge chair with an ottoman, and an ensuite bathroom. Bathroom 2 Features a shower, soft towels, a hairdryer, and premium organic essentials. Bedroom 3 Celestial Chamber Located on the ground floor, this suite boasts a king-sized bed, an ensuite bathroom, comfortable armchairs, and floor-to-ceiling windows that showcase the scenic hillside. Bathroom 3 Equipped with a shower, soft towels, a hairdryer, and organic toiletries. Bedroom 4 Alpine Lodge Perched on the second floor, this cosy attic retreat features a king-sized bed, a slatted wooden ceiling, a floor-to-ceiling window with scenic views, and access to a shared bathroom. Bathroom 4 Offers a shower, soft towels, premium toiletries, and a hairdryer. Dining Delight The modern kitchen is outfitted with high-gloss taupe cabinetry, premium finishes, and state-of-the-art appliances. The dining area features a tufted teal bench on one side of the table, paired with four floral-patterned high-back chairs on the other. Clubhouse Swimming Pool Serene outdoor pool with clean, modern edges | Infinity-style waterline with scenic views | Lined with vibrant potted flowering plants | Calm, nature-facing pool setting | Indoor games: chess, mini table tennis | Ideal for relaxed dips and leisurely swims | Well-maintained pool and surroundings | Peaceful ambience with forested backdrop | Perfect spot for unwinding and photos | Poolside plush seating | Umbrella patios Restaurant Sophisticated indoor-outdoor dining and lounge experience featuring luxurious furnishings, designer interiors, warm ambient lighting, stylish seating arrangements, seamless open-air integration, elegant alfresco dining under the stars, inviting social spaces, and an exclusive rooftop lounge offering breathtaking panoramic mountain views. Bar & restaurant Elegant wooden bar counter with classic panel detailing | Backlit display shelves for bottles and glassware | Warm ambient lighting with vintage chandelier | Rich wooden ceiling with exposed beams | Textured stone-finish accent walls | Spacious bar frontage for smooth service flow | Premium, old-world lounge vibe | Intimate and upscale drinking experience`,
