      { title: `Villa snapshot`, content: `Tucked away in a serene resort, far from the city's hustle, this charming cottage offers the perfect retreat for small groups seeking tranquility. Start the day with a cup of coffee on the balcony, enjoying breathtaking hill views! The charming bedroom delights with elegant decor, a comfortable sofa chair, a TV and skylights that allows natural light to stream in. Outside, the lush garden sets the stage for unforgettable moments, complete with a bonfire pit and ample seating for intimate gatherings. For those who love a bit of activity, the open space is perfect for outdoor sports, ensuring fun for all ages. Pack a picnic basket and enjoy a laid-back day in nature at a peaceful hillside spot. Indulge in an amazing dining experience at the resort’s exquisite restaurant, where floor-to-ceiling glass walls, soft ambient lighting, and air-conditioned comfort create an elegant setting to enjoy every meal with a view. Rooted in the ethos of "Atithi Devo Bhava," a top 5-star hospitality team is committed to ensuring every guest is pampered with exceptional care and attention. Note: The property is nestled in a secluded location, requiring guests to cover a 1 km off-road stretch to reach it. Bedroom One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 300 sq.ft | Skylights | TV | AC | Fan | Heater | Wardrobe space | Sofa chair | Attached balcony with seating | Hill view En suite Bathroom Shower, geyser, and hand jet spray | Hair dryer | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode Common garden 1800 sq.ft | Bonfire pit | Ample seating | Outdoor sports equipment | Hill view Outdoor sitting area Cosy seating | Swing chair | Scenic views Restaurant Stylish restaurant with seating | Ambient light fixtures | Glass walls | ACs | Music system | Scenic views` },
      { title: `Meals`, content: `Enjoy a selection of veg and non-veg meals during your stay. Additional features: A chef-on-call service is available at an additional charge with an exclusive in-house menu. Guests are not allowed to access the kitchen to prepare their meals.` },
      { title: `House rules`, content: `Check-in Instructions: Check-in: 2 PM | Check-out: 10 AM Refund Policy: For cancellations that comply with our policy terms, refunds will be processed as per the details below: 1. Refunds are only available if the full payment has been made; partial payments are non-refundable. 2. Refunds will be processed within 7-9 days post cancellation request. Security Deposit Amount: 2,500 Security Deposit Refund Policy: Refunds will be processed within 4-7 working days after property inspection. Your adherence to this timeline is appreciated. Noise & disturbances: Keep noise levels reasonable, especially between 10 pm and 7 am; no loud parties or events. Smoking: Smoking is strictly prohibited inside the villa. Designated smoking areas are available outdoors. Chewing tobacco: Strictly prohibited with no exceptions. Pets: Pets are allowed on the property. *Pet Friendly Property | Pet Policy* Pets Are Family – And They’re Welcome Here! We’re thrilled to host your furry friends at our pet-friendly homes. To ensure a safe and comfortable stay for all, here’s everything you need to know: Pet Security Deposit • 1 Pet – ₹10,000 (Refundable) • 2 Pets – ₹15,000 (Refundable) Collected in addition to the standard security deposit. Pet Sanitation Fee (One-time, collected at check-in) • 1BHK – ₹1,000 • 2/3BHK – ₹2,000 • 4/5BHK+ – ₹3,000 • Prive Collection – ₹4,000 Kindly Note • Pets are not allowed in the pool – A care charge of ₹10,000 will apply if this is overlooked. • Clean-up is your responsibility – Please pick up after your pets. • Damages, if any, will be charged at actuals. We love pets—and we’re so glad you brought yours along! Thank you for helping us keep our spaces clean, safe, and welcoming for everyone Occupancy: Follow maximum occupancy limits. Additional guests need prior approval. Damages: Guests are responsible for any damages or breakages during their stay. Please report any incidents to the management promptly. Charges may apply for repairs or replacements. Cleanliness: Please keep the villa clean, use the designated trash bins and avoid littering the property. Safety & security: Lock all doors and windows when leaving. We will not be responsible for any loss or theft of personal belongings. Amenities & facilities: Use the provided amenities responsibly and adhere to any posted guidelines. Compliance: Follow local laws and regulations. Illegal activities will result in eviction and potential legal action. Upkeep: Daily cleaning is compulsory. Kindly cooperate with our housekeeping team. Standard occupancy : 2 guests​ Maximum occupancy: 2 guests (Additional charges apply for extra guests beyond standard occupancy.)` },
      { title: `Nearest places`, content: `Kasauli Mall Road - 38.1 km Baptist Church, Kasauli - 38.3 km Manki Point - 41.6 km Barog Railway Station - 25.8 km` }
