      { title: `House Rules`, content: `Check-in Instructions: Check-in: 2 PM | Check-out: 12 AM Refund Policy: For cancellations that comply with our policy terms, refunds will be processed as per the details below: 1. Refunds are only available if the full payment has been made; partial payments are non-refundable. 2. Refunds will be processed within 7-9 days post cancellation request. 3. Refunds are only available if the full payment has been made; partial payments are non-refundable. ** Refunds will be processed within 7-9 days post-cancellation request. Security Deposit Amount: 2,500 Security Deposit Refund Policy: Refunds will be processed within 4-7 working days after property inspection. Your adherence to this timeline is appreciated. Noise & disturbances: Keep noise levels reasonable, especially between 10 pm and 7 am; no loud parties or events. Smoking: Smoking is strictly prohibited inside the villa. Designated smoking areas are available outdoors. Chewing tobacco: Strictly prohibited with no exceptions. Pets: Pets are allowed on the property. *Pet Friendly Property | Pet Policy* Pets Are Family – And They’re Welcome Here! We’re thrilled to host your furry friends at our pet-friendly homes. To ensure a safe and comfortable stay for all, here’s everything you need to know: Pet Security Deposit • 1 Pet – ₹10,000 (Refundable) • 2 Pets – ₹15,000 (Refundable) Collected in addition to the standard security deposit. Pet Sanitation Fee (One-time, collected at check-in) • 1BHK – ₹1,000 • 2/3BHK – ₹2,000 • 4/5BHK+ – ₹3,000 • Prive Collection – ₹4,000 Kindly Note • Pets are not allowed in the pool – A care charge of ₹10,000 will apply if this is overlooked. • Clean-up is your responsibility – Please pick up after your pets. • Damages, if any, will be charged at actuals. We love pets—and we’re so glad you brought yours along! Thank you for helping us keep our spaces clean, safe, and welcoming for everyone Occupancy: Follow maximum occupancy limits. Additional guests need prior approval. Damages: Guests are responsible for any damages or breakages during their stay. Please report any incidents to the management promptly. Charges may apply for repairs or replacements. Cleanliness: Please keep the villa clean, use the designated trash bins and avoid littering the property. Safety & security: Lock all doors and windows when leaving. We will not be responsible for any loss or theft of personal belongings. Amenities & facilities: Use the provided amenities responsibly and adhere to any posted guidelines. Compliance: Follow local laws and regulations. Illegal activities will result in eviction and potential legal action. Upkeep: Daily cleaning is compulsory. Kindly cooperate with our housekeeping team. Standard occupancy : 2 guests​ Maximum occupancy: 2 guests (Additional charges apply for extra guests beyond standard occupancy.)` },
      { title: `Nearest Places`, content: `Kasauli Mall Road - (38.1 km) Baptist Church, Kasauli - (38.3 km) Manki Point - (41.6 km) Barog Railway Station - (25.8 km)` }
