    description: `Get ready for a relaxing escape at this exclusive 4-BHK villa, just 20 km from Bushi Dam in Lonavala. The villa comes with spacious bedrooms, each with its own balcony, and one even has a bathtub for a refreshing soak. Outside, you’ll find a private pool with an LED fountain, a cosy cabana, and a gazebo that’s perfect for enjoying meals with family and friends. Spend your days playing pool or table tennis, cooling off in the pool, or hanging out on the lush garden, ideal for evening snacks and chats. With thoughtful services & 5-star hospitality team embracing "Atithi Devo Bhava and all the comforts you need, this getaway is set to give you some amazing memories to take home. Bedrooms Bedroom 1 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 300 sq. ft.| AC | Fan | Work/ study desk space | Electric kettle | Wardrobe space | Attached balcony with seating| Floor-to-ceiling glass doors | Garden view | Located on the first floor | Bathtub in the bathroom Bedroom 2 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 200 sq. ft.| AC | Fan | Work/ study desk space | Electric kettle | Wardrobe space | Attached balcony with pool access | Floor-to-ceiling glass door | Located on the ground floor Bedroom 3 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 250 sq. ft. | AC | Fan | Wardrobe space | Work/study desk space | Electric kettle | Wooden ceiling & lights| Attached balcony with seating | Garden view | Located on the first floor Bedroom 4 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 250 sq. ft. | AC | Fan | Wardrobe space | Work/study desk space | Electric kettle | Wooden ceiling & lights | Floor-to-ceiling glass doors | Garden view | Attached balcony | Located on the first floor Bathrooms Shower, geyser, and hand jet spray | Hair dryer | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode Living Room 480 sq. ft. | 72 " TV | Seating- Sofa sets, chairs & a table | Music system/ Speakers | AC | Fan | Lamps | Attached balcony with seating | Powder room (near the living room) | Located on the ground floor Kitchen Modern kitchen with ample storage space | Fully equipped with all the necessary appliances like microwave, crockery, cutlery, refrigerator, water purifier/ RO, toaster, mixer/grinder, rice cooker, air fryer, & kettle | Fan | Located on the ground floor Dining 8-seater dining table | Located on the ground floor | Fan | AC Outdoor Pool Private pool | 4.5 ft | Area: 350 | Poolside gazebo | Deck with seating areas | Beautifully painted wall | LED Fountain | warm lights | Swimming tubes Garden with Cabana 200 sq.ft | Cabana with seating | Fountain | Night lamps | Papaya trees | Unique sculptures | Kids play area | Pool table | Outdoor sports equipment | Expansive garden with lush foliage`,
