    has_pool: false,
    description: `Nestled in the picturesque surroundings of Solan, Shimla, this pet-friendly wooden cottage features a beautifully furnished bedroom and a balcony with captivating views. The wooden walls and ceiling add a touch of rustic charm, while the soft lighting creates a cosy ambience. The cottage has all essential amenities, including an attached bathroom for your convenience. Step out onto the private balcony to enjoy a mesmerising view of the lush greenery and distant mountains. This outdoor space is perfect for sipping your morning coffee or unwinding with a glass of wine in the evening. The exterior of the cottage is just as enchanting as the interior. Surrounded by tall pine trees and vibrant foliage, the property is a haven for nature lovers. The peaceful environment allows you to disconnect from the hustle and bustle of city life and reconnect with the tranquility of nature. This property also offers a delightful common area with both outdoor and indoor dining spaces, perfect for savoring local cuisine in the refreshing weather. And that’s not all—nestled in lush greenery, this place also boasts an outdoor area with a bonfire pit & for added fun. This cottage is not just a place to stay; it's an experience of comfort and tranquility. Whether you're here for a weekend escape or an extended stay, the inviting atmosphere and thoughtful design of this cottage make it a perfect choice for those seeking a nature getaway. Guests can delight in a visit to Mohan Shakti Heritage Park in Shimla, where they can experience its beautiful heritage and serene surroundings. They can also enjoy stunning views of the toy train from the property, adding a charming touch to their stay. NOTE- The road to the property may be slightly uneven due to ongoing construction, but we ensure it does not impact your overall stay. Bedroom One queen-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 400 sq.ft | Fan | AC | 32” TV | Wardrobe space | Attached balcony with seating | Hill view | Located on the ground floor Bathroom Shower, hairdryer, geyser, and hand jet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode Dining Spacious restaurant | Outdoor dining space | Indoor dining space | TV Outdoor Area Bonfire pit | Sitting area`,
