    description: `Set amidst the Aravalli hills, this majestic 5-BHK villa redefines elegance, offering an exquisite retreat where every corner is a visual delight. Staying at this 80,000 sq. ft of modern architectural brilliance is more than just a visit; it’s an experience! Step into the elegant living room, where grand glass windows frame breathtaking hill views, complemented by chic furnishings and an entertainment setup. The adjoining patio provides a cozy outdoor space, while the unique sunken pit features dual-purpose pool and table tennis table, creating the perfect spot for leisure. Each of the five bedrooms offers a distinctive charm: two open onto private balconies, ideal for morning coffee with a view, while two others lead to serene patios and one boasts a luxurious bathtub. Premium bedding, contemporary decor, and thoughtful amenities ensure unmatched comfort in every room. The open-layout kitchen is equipped with top-tier appliances, including a microwave, coffee machine, gas cooktop, dishwasher, and air fryer. The adjacent dining area, featuring a 10-seater table illuminated by an exquisite chandelier, is perfect for memorable meals with loved ones. The home theater with plush recliners offers the ideal setting for movie marathons, while the dedicated yoga and meditation corner and a fully equipped gym cater to wellness seekers. Outside, the beautiful garden features a striking natural boulder, ambient outdoor seating under twinkling fairy lights, and a sparkling pool. Relax on the deck or recline on the loungers to soak in the beauty of golden sunsets. To elevate this experience, a dedicated 5-star hospitality team is always on hand, ready to assist with a warm smile and genuine care, embodying the true essence of "Atithi Devo Bhava." From a butler and chef-on-call to a well-stocked fridge and a premium welcome basket, every detail is thoughtfully arranged to make guests feel cared for and pampered! शम्स Tal Take a refreshing dip in the private pool, complete with an outdoor shower, plush loungers, and a stunning backdrop of scenic hills. रोशनी Bagh The grand outdoors features a lush garden with seating, a striking boulder, and a charming sit-out with a swing. Soft, ambient lighting complements the breathtaking scenery, offering the perfect backdrop for ultimate relaxation. पैलेस Arcade Delight in indoor games within the sunken pit, featuring a versatile 2-in-1 pool and table tennis table, all framed by large windows overlooking the hills. रॉयल Cinema Enjoy an amazing entertainment experience in the home theater, featuring recliners, a comfortable sofa, a projector screen, and a premium sound system. निर्वाण Sanctuary A fitness center with top-tier equipment, cozy sofas, and a dedicated space for yoga and meditation—ideal for balancing strength and mindfulness. ज़ेवर Mahal The living room exudes charm with classy furnishings, an entertainment setup and grand windows that open to the garden and patio. Bedrooms शीश Darbar A stylish first-floor suite adorned with pristine white interiors, featuring a plush king-sized bed, a chic dressing room, elegant sofa chairs, and an ensuite bathroom. Bathroom-1 Designed with a shower, signature organic toiletries, plush towels, and a hairdryer. मेवाड़ Majesty Featuring warm wooden interiors, this first-floor retreat features a king-sized bed, a private balcony with seating, a dressing room, and an ensuite bathroom—crafted for your ultimate comfort. Bathroom-2 The bathroom boasts a luxurious bathtub, shower, soft towels, a hairdryer, and premium organic essentials. फतेह Harbour This first-floor suite blends elegance with modern comfort, featuring a king-sized bed, a foldable sofa bed, a dressing room, a balcony with seating, and an ensuite bathroom. Bathroom-3 It features premium organic amenities, a shower, fluffy towels, and a hairdryer. चंद्र Mahal An elegant ground-floor retreat featuring a plush king-sized bed, a dedicated workstation, a private dressing room, a charming patio, and an ensuite bathroom designed for ultimate comfort. Bathroom-4 The bathroom awaits with a shower, organic toiletries, soft towels, and a hairdryer. अरावली Heights A cosy ground-floor suite featuring a king-sized bed, a dedicated workstation, chic sofa chairs, a spacious dressing room, a private patio, and an ensuite bathroom. Bathroom-5 Fitted with a shower, a hairdryer, and premium organic toiletries. शाही Rasoi The kitchen offers modern appliances like a refrigerator, air fryer, oven and microwave, while the elegant ten-seater dining table provides the perfect setting for savouring meals.`,
